                        name="Features Item"
                        heading="State of Digital Experience 2025"
                        text="&lt;p&gt;Our annual benchmark report surveying 500+ enterprise digital leaders across 12 industries. Covers AI adoption in DXP, personalization maturity, content operations benchmarks, and top digital experience priorities for 2025&#8211;2026.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Format:&lt;/strong&gt; PDF Whitepaper, 42 pages&lt;/p&gt;"
