                        text="&lt;p&gt;A candid session with two enterprise customers who migrated from Adobe Experience Manager to DXP AI &#8212; covering their decision process, migration approach, timeline, and lessons learned.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 60 minutes | &lt;strong&gt;Available:&lt;/strong&gt; On-Demand&lt;/p&gt;"
